ection for the zig-zag (RMS falls slightly). Like wind, the effect is direction-dependent."},{"id":"gyro_bias","label":"Gyro bias","t":[],"rocket":null,"objects":[],"events":[],"plots":[{"id":"rms","title":"LOS cross-track RMS (aggressive path) vs gyro bias per axis","xlabel":"gyro bias per axis [rad/s]","ylabel":"m","series":[{"name":"mean","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[7.205,7.205,7.205,7.205],"mode":"lines+markers"},{"name":"min (seeds)","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[6.747,6.747,6.747,6.747],"mode":"lines"},{"name":"max (seeds)","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[7.756,7.756,7.756,7.756],"mode":"lines"},{"name":"pass limit 10 m","x":[0.0,0.02],"y":[10.0,10.0],"mode":"lines"}]},{"id":"hold","title":"Attitude hold: max true pointing error","xlabel":"gyro bias per axis [rad/s]","ylabel":"deg","series":[{"name":"mean","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[0.221,0.221,0.221,0.221],"mode":"lines+markers"},{"name":"min (seeds)","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[0.203,0.203,0.203,0.203],"mode":"lines"},{"name":"max (seeds)","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[0.238,0.238,0.238,0.238],"mode":"lines"},{"name":"pass limit 2 deg","x":[0.0,0.02],"y":[2.0,2.0],"mode":"lines"}]},{"id":"sat","title":"Gimbal saturation and AoA-clip fraction of the guided window","xlabel":"gyro bias per axis [rad/s]","ylabel":"%","series":[{"name":"LOS: gimbal at 5 deg","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[3.61,3.61,3.61,3.61],"mode":"lines+markers"},{"name":"hold: gimbal at 5 deg","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0],"mode":"lines+markers"},{"name":"LOS: AoA command at authority clip","x":[0.0,0.005,0.01,0.02],"y":[70.3,70.3,70.3,70.3],"mode":"lines+markers"}]}],"tables":[{"title":"Gyro bias: 5 seeds per level","columns":["gyro bias per axis [rad/s]","LOS RMS xte [m]","LOS max xte [m]","LOS worst WP pass [m]","LOS gimbal sat [%]","LOS AoA clip [%]","hold max err [deg]","hold max gimbal [deg]","hold gimbal sat [%]","LOS pass","hold pass"],"rows":[[0.0,"7.20 +- 0.38",10.5,8.8,3.6,70.0,"0.22 +- 0.01",1.72,0.0,"